\n\
Actually, Bloodstained Mire: \"{T}, Pay 1 life, Sacrifice {this}: Search your library for a Swamp or Mountain card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.\" It doesn't produce mana on its own.\n\
\n\
So I have 2 lands for adapt: Watery Grave and Blood Crypt. That's enough for {1}{B}.\n\
\n\
Actually, I could also fetch with Bloodstained Mire now to get a basic Swamp/Mountain. But that would cost 1 life and the land enters tapped (unless it's a shockland and I pay more life). Better to keep it for later.\n\
\n\
Actually, I could fetch for a basic Swamp to have BB available next turn for other spells.\n\
