\n\
So adapting again is pointless.\n\
\n\
Better to play Psychic Frog as a threat. It can grow with discard ability (discard a card: put +1/+1 counter). I have extra cards.\n\
\n\
But I only have 3 cards in graveyard for flying ability. Need 3 more cards to exile for flying.\n\
\n\
