      "reasoning": "Interesting! Psychic Frog is in my graveyard! It must have died during opponent's turn? Wait, Psychic Frog was on battlefield earlier. Now it's in graveyard. Opponent must have killed it with something during their turn (maybe they cast a removal spell). I missed that.\n\
