\n\
But I need to consider attacking. Emperor can attack for 4 damage, opponent at 5 life. That would leave them at 1 life. Not lethal.\n\
\n\
I need to find additional damage. Could cast Gran-Gran (1/2) for U, can't attack this turn (summoning sick). Could use Unearth to reanimate Psychic Frog (1/2) for B, but summoning sick.\n\
\n\
Better plan: Play Polluted Delta, fetch Island, cast Gran-Gran (1/2). Then adapt Emperor? No.\n\
\n\
Alternatively, flashback Faithless Looting for 2R (I have Blood Crypt for R, Watery Grave for U, Swamp for B). Could draw two cards, discard two, maybe find burn spell.\n\
\n\
But I don't have red mana currently. Blood Crypt produces R when tapped. I have 3 lands untapped: Blood Crypt, Swamp, Watery Grave. Could tap Blood Crypt for R, Watery Grave for U, Swamp for B.\n\
\n\
Flashback Faithless Looting costs 2R. I need RR? Actually 2R means {2}{R}. I can pay {R} from Blood Crypt, and two generic from any sources. I have Swamp and Watery Grave can produce generic? Actually they produce colored mana but can be used as generic. So I can pay: tap Blood Crypt for R, tap Swamp for B (used as generic), tap Watery Grave for U (used as generic). That's 3 mana total: R, B, U. That's {R}{B}{U} which is enough for {2}{R} because B and U can pay for generic. Yes.\n\
\n\
So I could flashback Faithless Looting, draw 2, discard 2. Might find a burn spell or something.\n\
\n\
But I have only 3 cards in graveyard (Bloodstained Mire, Faithless Looting, Raucous Theater). Need more cards for Abhorrent Oculus.\n\
\n\
Better to play Polluted Delta, fetch Island, cast Gran-Gran. Then attack with Emperor (4 damage). Opponent goes to 1 life. Then next turn kill with something.\n\
\n\
But opponent might play a blocker or gain more life.\n\
