      "better_line": "Crack Flooded Strand or Scalding Tarn for a land producing a second color, then cast Prismatic Ending for 2 colors (W + another) to exile Emperor of Bones (MV 2), preventing the Archon of Cruelty reanimation.",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 83,
      "player": "GPT5m Worrier",
      "decision_index": 45,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Attempted to cast Prismatic Ending before cracking fetchlands to generate the necessary mana. The spell was rolled back because the player couldn't complete the mana payment. The correct sequence is to activate Flooded Strand and/or Scalding Tarn first to get mana-producing lands onto the battlefield, then cast Prismatic Ending targeting Emperor of Bones (which has Archon of Cruelty exiled under it and threatens to reanimate it).",
